          <groundspeak:finder id="11091667">WillowZilla</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP348 - Dove of Hope

{found}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I parked down at the Muttart and hoofed it up here, around all the construction for the LRT ... only to find that my GZ was inside the fence line for the construction, luckily that was an easy solve, and the cap was in a really obvious survey marker manhole.  I had a tough time reading numbers but got lots of pictures.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
